{title: O Maahi Lo Main Qayamat Tak}
{artist: Dunki Arijit Singh Pritam}
{key: C#}

{c: Verse 1}
Yaara [C#] teri kahani [G#] mein,        [F#] Ho zikar [C#] mera,
Kahin [A#m] teri khamoshi [G#] mein,        [F#] Ho fikar [C#] mera,
rukh [C#] tera jidhar ka [G#] ho,        [F#] Ho udhar [C#] mera,
Teri [A#m] baahon talak hi [G#] hai,        [F#] Yeh safar [C#] mera,
[C#] O maahi, o maahi, o maahi, o maahi,        [F#] O maahi, o maahi, o maahi, o maahi,
[G#] Meri wafa pe haq hua [A#m] tera,        [C#] O maahi maahi [G#] ve,
[C#] O maahi, o maahi, o maahi, o maahi,        [F#] O maahi, o maahi, o maahi, o maahi,
[G#] Lo mai kayamat tak hua [A#m] tera [Fm] aa..        [G#] Lo main kayamat tak hua [C#] tera
[C#] Baaton ko behne do,        [A#m] Baahon mein rehne do,
[G#] Hai sukoon inn [F#] mein,        [C#] Raste woh begaane,
[A#m] Jhoothe woh afsaane,        [G#] Tu na ho jin [F#] mein,
Ho [C#] thodi umar hai [F#] pyar zyada [C#] mera,        [C#] Kaise pata yeh [F#] sara tera [C#] hoga,
[G#] Maine muze hai tuzko sonp [A#m] naa [C#] aa,        [C#] Aanhon pe baahon pe, raahon panahon pe,
[F#] Aanhon pe baahon pe, saahon salaahon pe,        [G#] Mere ishq pe haq hua [A#m] tera,
[C#] O maahi maahi [G#] ve,        [C#] O maahi, o maahi, o maahi, o maahi,
[F#] O maahi, o maahi, o maahi, o maahi,        [G#] Lo mai kayamat tak hua [A#m] tera [Fm] aa
